    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just constant. i wake up and i’m already behind. another day of making decisions that don't even matter in the long run, just moving numbers and managing people who don't care. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore, just a machine that runs a certain set of functions. i'm so tired of the noise.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
